# ── Binaries ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/orjanda
/bin/
/dist/

# ── Go toolchain ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Test cache and build cache are managed by $GOCACHE; nothing to ignore there.
# Cover profiles and test binaries
*.test
*.out
coverage.html
coverage.txt

# ── Database files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SQLite databases created by `orjanda serve` or tests
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ── Migrations (generated, not hand-authored) ────────────────────────────────
# Only ignore auto-generated migration artefacts, not the migrations/ dir itself.
migrations/*.generated.sql

# ── Configuration / secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
orjanda.local.yaml

# ── Editor / IDE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── golangci-lint cache ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.golangci-lint-cache/

# ── Node (orjanda-ui / @orjanda/codegen, Phase 9) ───────────────────────────
# orjanda-ui/dist is COMMITTED: the single Go binary embeds the production
# Vite build via embed.FS, so `go build` must never depend on a frontend step.
# Regenerate it with `npm run build` in orjanda-ui/.
node_modules/
orjanda-ui/.vite/
# Registry content-hash marker written by `orjanda serve`'s codegen pass
# (TAD §6.3 step 3); derived state, never committed.
orjanda-ui/src/generated/.registry-hash

# ── Temporary / scratch ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
tmp/
